{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"1638","name":"流浪大地的乐团","desc":"流浪大地的乐团","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/27/76373921/2846e3cca9387f0664bb4c9d9d8ad74e_5698650162673983894.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基础信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\" 稀有度 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e4星/5星\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\" 获取途径 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/719/detail\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e见闻奖励\u003c/a\u003e；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64)\\\"\u003e深境螺旋6-8层\u003c/span\u003e奖励「\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3821\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/09/19/183046623/ed58e3e6d14927e2e6705cdde61c57ea_8782152068936261256.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"深秘圣物匣·一等\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3821/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3821/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e深秘圣物匣·一等\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e」（5星）、4-8层奖励「\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3820\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/09/19/183046623/398d7c0dab6cf25ee9ece1f4ecf5dd16_7311331933027123601.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"深秘圣物匣·二等\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3820/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3820/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e深秘圣物匣·二等\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e」概率开出（4星）；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e世界等级3以上BOSS概率掉落；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/212/detail\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e北风的王狼\u003c/a\u003e等征讨领域概率掉落；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e合成台「还圣奥迹」获取；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"502145\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/08/28/50494840/d29726b96c9ee790cae261ddbc5f9989_3936286629804858604.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"圣言自明机\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e圣言自明机\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e定义获取。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"2件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e元素精通提高80点。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"4件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e装备该圣遗物套装的角色为法器、弓箭角色时，角色重击造成的伤害提高35%。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"4","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生之花","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"生之花：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"生之花：\",\"value\":[\"乐团的晨光\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/2846e3cca9387f0664bb4c9d9d8ad74e_7550662469203877197.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e小小的花形徽章。侧耳倾听的话，仿佛能听到悠扬的笛声和清新的歌唱声。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e花形的小小徽章，其中仿佛传出音乐声。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在那流浪的乐团里，有一位飒爽的剑士。\u003cbr\u003e比水上的霞光更明媚，优雅如报晓云雀。\u003cbr\u003e每当她挥舞利剑，笛音与歌都随风而起。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e一曲一舞落定如同雨霁天青。\u003cbr\u003e尘埃落定，台上下无有杂音。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e音乐与剑在她手中同等致命，同等优美。\u003cbr\u003e这便是流浪乐团的演奏，它有两种听众。\u003cbr\u003e听者是恶徒，乐声则远远传到舞台之外。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"5","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"死之羽","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"死之羽：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"死之羽：\",\"value\":[\"琴师的箭羽\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/1b80ea54a0c5ca5a0812cf21fbda09f8_4004180341505274127.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e青蓝色的箭羽，并未在漫长岁月中褪色破碎，似乎带来了落珠流水的琴声。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e靛青的挺拔箭羽，饱经风霜幸存至今。\u003cbr\u003e迎风震颤时似乎有乐声从羽梢中漏出。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e流浪乐团的琴师同时也是精湛的弓手。\u003cbr\u003e传说他能用温柔的琴声迷惑飞鸟，然后将之射下高空。\u003cbr\u003e据说在为鸟儿编织死亡之曲时，琴师从来低垂着眼帘。\u003cbr\u003e有人说这是乐师的自矜，也有同伴说这是猎手的仁慈。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e当可怜的牺牲品装点了琴师的箭矢，\u003cbr\u003e清脆的琴声也化作无情的报死哀声。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"6","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"时之沙","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"时之沙：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"时之沙：\",\"value\":[\"终幕的时计\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/c25b25eb2e979d80a3c2235f97f8c547_2472638080064270072.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e为乐团的演奏计时的沙漏，曾发出利落的声响。如今他们的表演已经落幕。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e流浪乐团的沙漏，本身便是一架琴。\u003cbr\u003e随着时间流逝，乐音也会愈发沉郁。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e每当表演即将结束，流浪乐团便会奏起竖琴。\u003cbr\u003e随着时间渐趋终点，竖琴的音色也愈发沉重。\u003cbr\u003e当低音在空气中弥散而尽，乐团演奏便告谢幕。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e而正如天下无不散之筵席，乐团本身也有竟时。\u003cbr\u003e当众人纷纷为宿命击倒，乐器埋葬于尘沙之下，\u003cbr\u003e乐团的时计也奏完了终曲。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"7","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"空之杯","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"空之杯：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"空之杯：\",\"value\":[\"吟游者之壶\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/6a49b5e9fdf8b9c7ad7e3049f476b92a_6894427272748945791.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e外形奇妙的古代水壶，内侧安装着琴弦，随流水而奏出无旋律的奇妙乐声。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e外形奇妙的水壶，能随流水奏出旋律。\u003cbr\u003e乐团成员即使饮水也不离乐曲的陪伴。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在古老的传说中，流浪乐团仗剑行走天地。\u003cbr\u003e以剑、弓为笛与琴，莫论来者宾客或寇仇。\u003cbr\u003e他们曾漫步沙漠，也曾踏入阴燃的烬寂海。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e壶内荡漾的琴声时刻提醒着他们：\u003cbr\u003e「我们的足迹与无边的音律同调」\u003cbr\u003e「何处有音乐声，何处就有我们」\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"8","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"理之冠","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"理之冠：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"理之冠：\",\"value\":[\"指挥的礼帽\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/2b655b680c1f9e32abb93f0ebba82316_6639924106814904139.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e尽管饱经风霜，但依旧光彩照人的礼帽。其中似乎回荡着古老悠扬的乐声。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e漂亮的礼帽，历经岁月却依然光彩照人。\u003cbr\u003e仔细倾听，似乎回荡着古老悠扬的乐声。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e千百年前，一支乐团在大地上流浪。\u003cbr\u003e乐团无乐谱。见所见而歌，闻所闻而奏。\u003cbr\u003e后来，随着乐团愈发见识到世界的广袤，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「啊啊。这世上，可唱的竟有如此之多」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e成员们以音符为语言，将所见所闻写下。\u003cbr\u003e至死仍将流浪乐章掬在手中的便是指挥。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"9","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"搭配推荐","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色推荐\",\"header\":[\"角色名称\",\"推荐原因\",\"词缀搭配\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\\n\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1433\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/8b9946e573bf7aff9801c580707a23e1_3026364173026253689.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"甘雨\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1433/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1433/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/8b9946e573bf7aff9801c580707a23e1_3026364173026253689.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e甘雨\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\\n\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e甘雨为站场输出角色，主要输出方式为蓄力射击。在融化队伍中，元素精通具有较高的收益。流浪大地的乐团套装能够为甘雨提供大量且稳定的蓄力射击伤害加成，并且提供的元素精通也能提高元素反应的伤害，适合融化流甘雨使用。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比/元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e冰元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\\n\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"55\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/06/21/283462834/d2972c634d9d81979774b22b49d1ab01_887661176891008491.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"可莉\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/55/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/55/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/06/21/283462834/d2972c634d9d81979774b22b49d1ab01_887661176891008491.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e可莉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\\n\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e可莉为站场输出角色，对于重击蒸发流可莉，流浪大地的乐团四件套套装效果能够为可莉提供大量且稳定的重击伤害加成，其二件套提供元素精通可用于提高反应伤害，适合重击蒸发流可莉使用。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e火元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"4334\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/08/23/75379475/6953568084aaa02bc7a774430f1f3b56_9172357402103659910.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"提纳里\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4334/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4334/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/08/23/75379475/6953568084aaa02bc7a774430f1f3b56_9172357402103659910.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e提纳里\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e提纳里的主要输出方式为释放元素战技后的蓄力射击，常用于激化体系。在激化体系中，元素精通词条收益较高，流浪大地的乐团套装可为提纳里提供元素精通并给予蓄力射击伤害加成，适合提纳里使用。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通/攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e草元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"501212\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/25/195563531/94b2aad4aa86087da3427cfd13223406_1838144106966207925.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"赛索斯\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/501212/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/501212/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/25/195563531/94b2aad4aa86087da3427cfd13223406_1838144106966207925.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e赛索斯\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e赛索斯的主要输出方式为通过消耗能量缩短蓄力时间进行快速射击，常用于激化体系。在激化体系中，元素精通词条收益较高，流浪大地的乐团套装可为赛索斯提供元素精通并给予蓄力射击伤害加成，适合赛索斯使用。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e雷元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\\n\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"54\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/02/16/6276411/138132721f21bf60c53a8935a8fb0107_8908120754759624960.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"安柏\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/54/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/54/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/02/16/6276411/138132721f21bf60c53a8935a8fb0107_8908120754759624960.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e安柏\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\\n\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e安柏可作为输出向角色培养，流浪大地的乐团套装能够为安柏提供大量且稳定的蓄力射击伤害加成，并且提供的元素精通也能提高元素反应的伤害，适合蓄力流安柏使用。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e火元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\\n\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1795\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/b8952d8a5d2d266126ce370c4eb78438_4209492093986588378.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"烟绯\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1795/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1795/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/b8952d8a5d2d266126ce370c4eb78438_4209492093986588378.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003c